OL,3,GNEWSATwo-hour ambulance handover limit
OL,4,Amissed more than 2,000 times
OL,5,
OL,6,FA two-hour ambulance handover limit at
OL,7,Femergency departments is going to be
OL,8,F"very challenging" to achieve this
OL,9,Fwinter, according to a senior doctor.
OL,11,FThe Release to Rescue initiative was
OL,12,Fintroduced this year to ensure a
OL,13,Fmaximum two-hour wait for patients and
OL,14,Fto free up crews to respond to calls
OL,15,Fmore quickly.
OL,17,FBut more than 2,000 ambulance handovers
OL,18,Fbreached the two-hour wait time between
OL,19,FMay and August, the first four full
OL,20,Fmonths of the scheme.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
