OL,3,GNEWSATwo-hour ambulance handover limit
OL,4,Amissed more than 2,000 times
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department of Health said the
OL,7,Fscheme had delivered "improvements",
OL,8,Fwith more than 6,000 waits of two hours
OL,9,For more in the same period last year.
